I think I got it, I messed things up a little.

Conf dir in is `/opt/adguardhome/conf` and not `/tmp` of course, this comes from my init container which copies the config to the proper location inside the pod.

Again I copied the config before I blocked any services and then did a diff after I updated the setting.

Setting to set is:
`blocked_services`

I even got this in my ConfigMap, maybe to late for tinkering around.

/Solved ;)

